CHIP MATRIX MACH211
PIN 10 A
PIN 32 B
PIN 14 C
PIN 15 D
PIN 16 E
PIN 17 F
PIN 11 CLK
PIN 2 Q0 REG
PIN 3 Q1 REG
PIN 4 Q2 REG
PIN 5 Q3 
EQUATIONS
Q0=/A*/D+B*/C*D+/E*F+A*D*F+/C*F+/B*E*F+/C*D
Q0.CLKF=CLK
Q1.T=/A*/E*/F+/B*/C*F+A*C*E*/F+A*B*F+/A*/E+/A*/C*/D*/F+/A*/B*/D*E
Q1.CLKF=CLK
Q2=(C*/D*E*F+/B*C*D*/F+/B*/C*F+/C*/E*F+C*/F+/A*B*/D*/E+/A*/B*/D*/F) :+: F
Q2.CLKF=CLK
Q3=A*/B*/D*/E+/C*D*/F+B*/E+/B*D*/E*/F+/A*B*C*/F+/C*/D+B*/C*/D*/E
